      "id": "def_host_body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 52,
      "y": 123,
      "width": 621,
      "height": 34,
      "text": "Your physical Linux computer (e.g. 61 GiB RAM). Only ONE Host exists.\nHost-shared page pools & lazy shared daemons (acos-webview, acos-netd) live here once.",
