      "id": "aosp_app_a_body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 90,
      "y": 399,
      "width": 268,
      "height": 109,
      "text": "• Your APK + Compose / RN\n• Activity, View, Looper (per-app)\n• *Manager client proxies\n  (PackageManager, WindowManager)\n• Own ART heap + native malloc\n• Shares read-only framework.jar\n  via VM-local Zygote CoW",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Your APK + Compose / RN\n• Activity, View, Looper (per-app)\n• *Manager client proxies\n  (PackageManager, WindowManager)\n• Own ART heap + native malloc\n• Shares read-only framework.jar\n  via VM-local Zygote CoW",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
