      "type": "text",
      "x": 398,
      "y": 399,
      "width": 268,
      "height": 109,
      "text": "• SystemUI, Launcher, Settings\n• PermissionController\n• WebView Provider (Chromium\n  renderer — ~150-250 MiB!)\n• Content Providers (per owner)\n• Each runs in its own PID\n  inside this VM's RAM",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• SystemUI, Launcher, Settings\n• PermissionController\n• WebView Provider (Chromium\n  renderer — ~150-250 MiB!)\n• Content Providers (per owner)\n• Each runs in its own PID\n  inside this VM's RAM",
