      "text": "Single source of truth inside VM:\n• PackageManagerService (PMS)\n• ActivityTaskManagerService\n• WindowManagerService (WMS)\n• Notification & Permission Svcs\n• Location, Telephony, Settings\n• Runs ALL services always-on",
