      "id": "aosp_kernel_body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 90,
      "y": 896,
      "width": 576,
      "height": 64,
      "text": "• Full Android Linux Kernel booted from scratch per VM (cold boot ~25.2 s)\n• Hardware Abstraction Layers (Gralloc, Audio, Camera, Radio, Sensors)\n• QEMU/KVM virtual machine RAM reservation + emulated GPU / SwiftShader\n• Full /system, /vendor, /data disk images per emulator instance",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Full Android Linux Kernel booted from scratch per VM (cold boot ~25.2 s)\n• Hardware Abstraction Layers (Gralloc, Audio, Camera, Radio, Sensors)\n• QEMU/KVM virtual machine RAM reservation + emulated GPU / SwiftShader\n• Full /system, /vendor, /data disk images per emulator instance",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
