      "id": "acos_app1_body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1084,
      "y": 464,
      "width": 381,
      "height": 114,
      "text": "• Your APK + Compose / RN + JNI .so\n• REAL AOSP framework.jar (API 34)\n• REAL Google ART (dalvikvm64 + Bionic)\n• ACOS LD_PRELOAD shim (binder_driver.c)\nPrivate RAM breakdown (N=20 measured):\n  Exec: 37 MiB (boot CoW 10.2, GC/malloc 9.8,\n    Dalvik 7.1, lib CoW 4.5, odex 3.8)\n  Zygote: 23.2 MiB (eliminates 14M CoW!)",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Your APK + Compose / RN + JNI .so\n• REAL AOSP framework.jar (API 34)\n• REAL Google ART (dalvikvm64 + Bionic)\n• ACOS LD_PRELOAD shim (binder_driver.c)\nPrivate RAM breakdown (N=20 measured):\n  Exec: 37 MiB (boot CoW 10.2, GC/malloc 9.8,\n    Dalvik 7.1, lib CoW 4.5, odex 3.8)\n  Zygote: 23.2 MiB (eliminates 14M CoW!)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
