      "id": "acos_mods_body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1396,
      "y": 717,
      "width": 298,
      "height": 101,
      "text": "In-process Rust state (~1-2 MiB budget ea):\n• accessibility, permissions, notifications\n• sensors, location, wifi, telephony, bt,\n  biometric, vibrator, media.session\nHost-tool bridges (per-session slice only):\n• network: veth+netns (+0-2 MiB/sess)\n• webview: browser ctx (+4 MiB/sess)",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "In-process Rust state (~1-2 MiB budget ea):\n• accessibility, permissions, notifications\n• sensors, location, wifi, telephony, bt,\n  biometric, vibrator, media.session\nHost-tool bridges (per-session slice only):\n• network: veth+netns (+0-2 MiB/sess)\n• webview: browser ctx (+4 MiB/sess)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
