      "type": "text",
      "x": 1070,
      "y": 969,
      "width": 202,
      "height": 114,
      "text": "Linux page cache + CoW:\n• framework.jar (~20M)\n• boot-framework.art/oat\n• Fonts (~15.4 MiB)\n• libart, libhwui, libgui\n• Shared APK DEX\n→ ~0 MiB unique per\n  extra session!",
