      "type": "text",
      "x": 1306,
      "y": 969,
      "width": 202,
      "height": 114,
      "text": "0 MiB if no WebView!\nStarted on 1st connect:\n• 1 shared headless\n  Chromium on Host\n• 1 isolated browser\n  context per session\n  (+~4 MiB/session)\n(vs 200M/VM in AOSP)",
