      "type": "text",
      "x": 1542,
      "y": 969,
      "width": 202,
      "height": 114,
      "text": "0 MiB if offline!\n• 1 relay netns + 1 pasta\n  process for whole Host\n• Flat 26 MiB from\n  N=1 to N=20 sessions\n• Each session gets own\n  veth+netns (offline,\n  delay, loss controls)",
