      "type": "text",
      "x": 1778,
      "y": 969,
      "width": 194,
      "height": 114,
      "text": "• Software GLES:\n  angle-swiftshader\n  32 MB disk, 0 MiB RAM\n  if app skips EGL\n• Host Zygote keeper:\n  warm-fork shares boot\n  CoW → saves ~14 MiB\n  per session (-31%!)",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Software GLES:\n  angle-swiftshader\n  32 MB disk, 0 MiB RAM\n  if app skips EGL\n• Host Zygote keeper:\n  warm-fork shares boot\n  CoW → saves ~14 MiB\n  per session (-31%!)",
